msgstr ""
"Para ``hashcash``, ``difficulty`` es el número de bits y ``challenges`` "
"vale ``0``."

#: ../../protocol.rst:50
msgid ""
"A Web Worker solves it with the WebAssembly module, or the JavaScript "
"prover if WebAssembly is unavailable (Part VII), and posts either"
msgstr ""
"Un Web Worker lo resuelve con el módulo WebAssembly, o con el probador "
"JavaScript si WebAssembly no está disponible (parte VII), y envía o bien"

#: ../../protocol.rst:52
msgid "{\"challenge_id\":\"...\",\"nonce\":\"90766\"}"
msgstr "{\"challenge_id\":\"...\",\"nonce\":\"90766\"}"

#: ../../protocol.rst:56
msgid "or"
msgstr "o bien"

#: ../../protocol.rst:58
msgid ""
"{\"challenge_id\":\"...\",\"proof\":\"<base64url, 32(1 + t(n+1)) bytes>\"}"
msgstr ""
"{\"challenge_id\":\"...\",\"proof\":\"<base64url, 32(1 + t(n+1)) bytes>\"}"

#: ../../protocol.rst:62
msgid "to ``POST /__sibuna/verify``."
msgstr "a ``POST /__sibuna/verify``."

#: ../../protocol.rst:63
msgid ""
"On success the server answers ``200 {\"status\":\"ok\"}`` with a "
"``Set-Cookie`` header, and the page reloads its original location. Every "
"later request carries the cookie and is admitted before policy evaluation."
msgstr ""
"Si la verificación tiene éxito, el servidor responde ``200 "
"{\"status\":\"ok\"}`` con una cabecera ``Set-Cookie``, y la página "
"recarga su ubicación original. Cada petición posterior lleva la cookie y "
"se admite antes de evaluar las políticas."

#: ../../protocol.rst:65
msgid "Why the path travels with the challenge"
msgstr "Por qué la ruta viaja con el desafío"

#: ../../protocol.rst:67
msgid ""
"The interstitial is served at the protected URL, so the browser knows "
"where it is. Sending the path lets the server pick the *per-rule* "
"difficulty and algorithm (a checkout route may demand 20 work bits of "
"sequential work while a blog demands 16 bits of Hashcash) and binds the "
"rule hash into the token, where ``X-Sibuna-Rule-Hash`` reports it "
"upstream."
msgstr ""
"La página intermedia se sirve en la URL protegida, así que el navegador "
"sabe dónde está. Enviar la ruta permite al servidor elegir la dificultad "
"y el algoritmo *de cada regla* (una ruta de pago puede exigir 20 bits de "
"trabajo secuencial mientras que un blog exige 16 bits de Hashcash) y "
"vincula el hash de la regla al token, desde donde ``X-Sibuna-Rule-Hash`` "
"lo comunica al origen."

#: ../../protocol.rst:69
msgid "The Stateless Challenge Record"
msgstr "El registro de desafío sin estado"

#: ../../protocol.rst:74
msgid ""
"Read the challenge encoder, understand every field's purpose, and see how "
"the per-challenge nonce is derived without an entropy syscall on the hot "
"path."
msgstr ""
"Lee el codificador de desafíos, comprende el propósito de cada campo y "
"observa cómo se deriva el nonce de cada desafío sin una llamada al "
"sistema para obtener entropía en la ruta crítica."

#: ../../protocol.rst:76
msgid "Implementation: ``Coordinator::create_challenge_with_spec``"
msgstr "Implementación: ``Coordinator::create_challenge_with_spec``"

#: ../../protocol.rst:78
msgid ""
"Builds the 36-byte payload, tags it under the challenge key, and "
"base64url-encodes the 52 bytes into a 70-character identifier. In "
"``crates/challenge/src/coordinator.rs`` (crate ``sibuna-challenge``)."
msgstr ""
"Construye la carga útil de 36 bytes, la etiqueta con la clave de desafíos "
"y codifica en base64url los 52 bytes como un identificador de 70 "
"caracteres. En ``crates/challenge/src/coordinator.rs`` (crate "
"``sibuna-challenge``)."

#: ../../protocol.rst:80
msgid ""
"pub fn create_challenge_with_spec(\n"
"    &self,\n"
"    client_ip: &[u8],\n"
"    user_agent: &[u8],\n"
"    now: u64,\n"
"    spec: ChallengeSpec,\n"
"    rule_hash: u64,\n"
") -> Challenge {\n"
"    self.adaptive.observe(now.saturating_mul(1000));\n"
"    let effective = ChallengeSpec {\n"
"        difficulty: "
"spec.difficulty.saturating_add(self.adaptive.bump()),\n"
"        ..spec\n"
"    };\n"
"    let fingerprint = self.fingerprint(client_ip, user_agent);\n"
"    let difficulty = effective.parameter();\n"
"    let challenges = match effective.algorithm {\n"
"        Algorithm::Hashcash => 0,\n"
"        Algorithm::Posw => effective.posw_challenges,\n"
"    };\n"
"\n"
"    let mut payload = [0u8; ID_PAYLOAD_LEN];\n"
"    payload[0] = ID_VERSION;\n"
"    payload[1] = effective.algorithm.to_byte();\n"
"    payload[2] = difficulty;\n"
"    payload[3] = challenges;\n"
"    payload[4..12].copy_from_slice(&now.to_le_bytes());\n"
"    payload[12..20].copy_from_slice(&fingerprint.to_le_bytes());\n"
"    payload[20..28].copy_from_slice(&self.next_nonce(now, "
"fingerprint).to_le_bytes());\n"
"    payload[28..36].copy_from_slice(&rule_hash.to_le_bytes());\n"
"    let mut raw = [0u8; ID_RAW_LEN];\n"
"    raw[..ID_PAYLOAD_LEN].copy_from_slice(&payload);\n"
"    "
"raw[ID_PAYLOAD_LEN..].copy_from_slice(&self.challenge_tag(&payload));\n"
"\n"
"    Challenge {\n"
"        id: encoded::encode(&raw),\n"
"        algorithm: effective.algorithm,\n"
"        difficulty,\n"
"        challenges,\n"
"        expires_at: now.saturating_add(u64::from(self.challenge_ttl)),\n"
"    }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"pub fn create_challenge_with_spec(\n"
"    &self,\n"
"    client_ip: &[u8],\n"
"    user_agent: &[u8],\n"
"    now: u64,\n"
"    spec: ChallengeSpec,\n"
"    rule_hash: u64,\n"
") -> Challenge {\n"
"    self.adaptive.observe(now.saturating_mul(1000));\n"
"    let effective = ChallengeSpec {\n"
"        difficulty: "
"spec.difficulty.saturating_add(self.adaptive.bump()),\n"
"        ..spec\n"
"    };\n"
"    let fingerprint = self.fingerprint(client_ip, user_agent);\n"
"    let difficulty = effective.parameter();\n"
"    let challenges = match effective.algorithm {\n"
"        Algorithm::Hashcash => 0,\n"
"        Algorithm::Posw => effective.posw_challenges,\n"
"    };\n"
"\n"
"    let mut payload = [0u8; ID_PAYLOAD_LEN];\n"
"    payload[0] = ID_VERSION;\n"
"    payload[1] = effective.algorithm.to_byte();\n"
"    payload[2] = difficulty;\n"
"    payload[3] = challenges;\n"
"    payload[4..12].copy_from_slice(&now.to_le_bytes());\n"
"    payload[12..20].copy_from_slice(&fingerprint.to_le_bytes());\n"
"    payload[20..28].copy_from_slice(&self.next_nonce(now, "
"fingerprint).to_le_bytes());\n"
"    payload[28..36].copy_from_slice(&rule_hash.to_le_bytes());\n"
"    let mut raw = [0u8; ID_RAW_LEN];\n"
"    raw[..ID_PAYLOAD_LEN].copy_from_slice(&payload);\n"
"    "
"raw[ID_PAYLOAD_LEN..].copy_from_slice(&self.challenge_tag(&payload));\n"
"\n"
"    Challenge {\n"
"        id: encoded::encode(&raw),\n"
"        algorithm: effective.algorithm,\n"
